in his presidency.

00:04:17.924 --> 00:04:18.958 line:92%
How do you distinguish yoursel

00:04:18.958 --> 00:04:21.094 align:start size:94% position:6%
not just from what
President Trump did,

00:04:21.094 --> 00:04:21.828 line:92%
but what President Obama,

00:04:21.828 --> 00:04:23.863 align:start size:94% position:6%
an administration
you worked for, did?

00:04:23.863 --> 00:04:24.664 size:75% position:38% line:92%
-Yeah, well, I mean,

00:04:24.664 --> 00:04:27.066
I think what happened in
the Obama administration is that

00:04:27.066 --> 00:04:31.404 align:start size:94% position:6%
the Obama administration,
over the years got stronger,

00:04:31.404 --> 00:04:33.840 size:88% position:44%
got better on that issue
of immigration, right?

00:04:33.840 --> 00:04:38.578 align:start size:94% position:6%
I mean, in 2012,
you had DACA that was released

00:04:38.578 --> 00:04:40.346 line:92%
And then in 2014 they did DAPA

00:04:40.346 --> 00:04:43.216 size:78% position:39%
which was supposed to
cover the parents.

00:04:43.216 --> 00:04:44.851 align:start size:94% position:6%
The number of
deportations of people

00:04:44.851 --> 00:04:47.020 align:start size:94% position:6%
