through those years.

00:04:47.020 --> 00:04:49.355 align:start size:94% position:6%
And the other lesson that
think we learned

00:04:49.355 --> 00:04:53.293
from that administration was
that when we have the chance -

00:04:53.293 --> 00:04:55.228 align:start size:94% position:6%
