a Democratic president,

00:05:00.099 --> 00:05:03.803 align:start size:94% position:6%
a Democratic House,
and a Democratic Senate.

00:05:03.803 --> 00:05:05.104 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Applause ]

00:05:05.104 --> 00:05:09.709 align:start size:94% position:6%
What we learned is that
from the 2009, 2010 experience

00:05:09.709 --> 00:05:12.211 align:start size:94% position:6%
is don't wait on
immigration reform.

00:05:12.211 --> 00:05:13.846 line:92%
We're not gonna wait this time

00:05:13.846 --> 00:05:16.516 align:start size:94% position:6%
We're gonna push
sensible immigration reform.

00:05:16.516 --> 00:05:20.987 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You know, you mentioned
an ideal outcome for yoursel

00:05:20.987 --> 00:05:24.390
would, of course, be, you know
the presidency and both houses

00:05:24.390 --> 00:05:27.327
You know, one of the thing
that might actually seem lik

00:05:27.327 --> 00:05:28.661 align:start size:94% position:6%
the hardest right now
